  vendorName: Botanist Thorne
  offerText: Pay my fee, and I shall place this massive, rather ugly fungal terrarium
    in your corner. It requires significant space and capital.
  acceptResultText: You pay the fee and sacrifice your corner. Surprisingly, the
    strange fungus releases natural spores that completely clear your lungs and cure
    your lingering cough!
  rejectResultText: You refuse the ugly plant. You keep your money, but the air in
    your room remains dreadfully stale.
